# Long-duration / seasonal When — Through date

When a seasonal / long-duration event has a **published closing date**, event page WHEN and the sticky rail must include:

**Through [Mon D]** (e.g. `Through Nov 15`)

Never use “Ends Nov 15”. Never invent a closing date.

Optional **`scheduleNote`** (smaller italic on event WHEN only): caveats like weekday exceptions under the recurrence · hours line. Omit from browse cards and the sticky rail.

## Surfaces

| Surface | End date |
| --- | --- |
| Browse card | Omit Through — status + hours only |
| Event page WHEN | Status → recurrence · hours → optional italic scheduleNote → **Through …** when known |
| Sticky rail | Status → hours → **Through …** when known (no scheduleNote) |
| No published close | Omit Through; optional tip that no closing date is listed |

